# Cloudflare Pages serves real static files (/assets/*, /fonts/*, favicon,
# sitemap.xml, rss.xml, robots.txt, …) and Functions (/api/*) directly. This
# file only applies to paths with NO matching file/function.

# SPA fallback for application routes (/home, /blog, /git-profile, …).
#
# NOTE: `_redirects` only supports 200 (rewrite) and 3xx (redirect) statuses —
# a `... 404` rule is INVALID and makes Cloudflare reject the whole file, which
# silently disables this SPA fallback (every deep link then 404s). So we do NOT
# try to force-404 missing /assets/* here. Stale/missing hashed chunks are
# handled instead by content-hashed filenames + the `vite:preloadError` reload
# in src/main.tsx.
